WEBVTT

00:20.770 --> 00:26.570
A river that flows through the center of the city, or mountains that tower in the distance…

00:26.570 --> 00:28.370
It’s like that.

00:28.370 --> 00:30.770
It’s just there.

00:30.800 --> 00:37.000
It’s a mystery, but there’s nothing inconvenient about not knowing.

00:37.900 --> 00:44.210
Living next to an unknown object might be a problem, though.

00:46.040 --> 00:47.640
More importantly, now…

00:49.790 --> 00:53.340
Help me!

00:53.340 --> 00:55.950
This is much more of a problem!

01:02.020 --> 01:04.100
Let me say something important.

01:05.770 --> 01:08.820
I’m Badou, an information gatherer.

01:08.820 --> 01:10.370
While entering and leaving the dark parts of the city,

01:10.370 --> 01:13.610
I get ahold of dangerous information and sell it at a high price.

01:13.610 --> 01:15.880
It’s a hard-boiled job.

01:15.880 --> 01:18.480
But, since the economy has been bad lately,

01:18.480 --> 01:21.190
life is tough, so today,

01:21.190 --> 01:26.620
I’m stuck to a hotel’s window, during a cheap adultery investigation.

01:30.780 --> 01:34.310
Jeez, going at it in the middle of the afternoon…

01:36.880 --> 01:39.940
Uh… w-w-wait- Shi-

01:45.240 --> 01:47.740
Really?!

01:51.600 --> 01:54.830
Way too uncool.

01:54.830 --> 01:57.170
My ci-cigarette…

01:57.170 --> 01:59.420
Even though I just opened it!

02:04.750 --> 02:11.110
What I saw there was the Don of the West 4th Street Family

02:11.110 --> 02:13.470
in a situation overflowing with extraordinariness.

02:13.940 --> 02:16.720
U-Um…

02:18.630 --> 02:21.400
How about a commemorative photo?

02:23.160 --> 02:25.780
Help me!

02:26.130 --> 02:29.550
They’re really bold for going at it this early, but

02:29.550 --> 02:32.130
I think they are quite stupid for doing so.

02:32.130 --> 02:38.290
Hey, can’t we stop shooting at the unarmed man like that?

02:38.690 --> 02:40.110
Let’s be friendly!

02:40.110 --> 02:41.110
Brother!

02:41.110 --> 02:43.380
How can we let someone who knows the Boss’s hobby live?!

02:43.400 --> 02:45.300
Stop mumbling and just die!

02:51.090 --> 02:52.990
Where are you aiming, you amateurs?

02:52.990 --> 02:53.800
Damn it…

02:53.800 --> 02:54.810
Hey you!

02:54.880 --> 02:55.510
What?

02:56.520 --> 02:57.970
Hey, Mimi.

02:58.490 --> 03:00.750
I’ve got some good apples today.

03:00.750 --> 03:02.280
Really? Let’s see…

03:05.400 --> 03:08.050
Oh, Badou!

03:10.160 --> 03:11.850
I thought I would die…

03:12.130 --> 03:15.550
Yet again you’ve made a blunder while gathering cheap information.

03:15.550 --> 03:17.400
Shut up, Mimi.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.890
More importantly, do you have any cigarette?

03:18.890 --> 03:20.450
Ew, you stink!

03:20.450 --> 03:22.450
Don’t come close!

03:23.390 --> 03:24.950
Really!

03:24.320 --> 03:25.990
Hey! He’s still alive!

03:25.990 --> 03:27.880
Don’t move from there!

03:27.880 --> 03:30.080
Looks like we don’t have time for this.

03:31.190 --> 03:34.130
Do I still have to run?

03:34.130 --> 03:35.300
Damn it!

03:35.910 --> 03:38.510
Will he die from this?

03:38.510 --> 03:40.860
What’s that?

03:40.860 --> 03:42.680
Oh, master!

03:42.680 --> 03:43.900
Is your injury fine now?

03:44.200 --> 03:48.900
In truth, it still hurts, but the store chief’s treatment of people is rough.

03:48.960 --> 03:51.890
As I said, I’m really in trouble!

03:51.890 --> 03:54.310
Isn’t manual labor your area of expertise?

03:54.310 --> 03:55.070
Heine!

03:55.790 --> 03:56.870
Huh?

03:56.870 --> 03:59.620
You haven’t slept at all since the day before yesterday?

03:59.620 --> 04:01.820
Why should I care about something like that?!

04:01.820 --> 04:05.460
I’ve said so much that if you don’t limit your strolling hobby, you’ll collapse!

04:05.460 --> 04:08.690
You should listen to me!

04:09.250 --> 04:10.810
Hey, are you listening, Heine-kun?!

04:10.850 --> 04:12.760
I was worried about you, and-!

04:13.450 --> 04:14.780
Oh…

04:17.240 --> 04:22.670
Shit! No cigarette, and Heine’s ignoring me again…

04:23.080 --> 04:24.810
This is the worst.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.130
Oh…

04:30.030 --> 04:32.180
Oh, that’s strange…

04:32.180 --> 04:34.360
Was I supposed to go right at that last street?

04:39.280 --> 04:41.620
Do you have any last words?

04:42.520 --> 04:44.370
Do you have any cigarette?

04:44.750 --> 04:47.480
I’m sorry, I ran out.

04:49.210 --> 04:50.300
You don’t have any?

04:50.740 --> 04:53.580
If you want to smoke so badly, go smoke in hell-!

04:57.090 --> 04:59.470
Oh, my bad.

04:59.470 --> 05:01.430
Who are you?

05:01.430 --> 05:04.660
Mihai, the assassin!

05:08.370 --> 05:10.980
Sorry, but where am I?

05:11.230 --> 05:12.430
Yes?

05:39.630 --> 05:43.140
I want to smoke… cigarette!

05:44.240 --> 05:45.140
Newspaper.

05:45.390 --> 05:47.520
Good job as always, Nao-chan!

05:49.810 --> 05:51.000
Thanks.

05:53.610 --> 05:56.820
…that’s how my explanation goes.

05:57.400 --> 06:01.230
I thought you were pretty skillful, even though you’re so unlucky.

06:01.230 --> 06:02.680
Shut up!

06:02.680 --> 06:06.840
But of all families, the Bourdone family of the West, eh?

06:06.840 --> 06:11.340
They’re right in the middle of a dispute with the Rowano of the East right now.

06:12.050 --> 06:13.870
Did you say your name was “Badou”?

06:13.870 --> 06:16.620
They now think you’re a dog of the East.

06:17.880 --> 06:20.150
Then it’s easy!

06:20.150 --> 06:23.170
You just have to sell that information to the Rowano!

06:23.570 --> 06:26.280
By next week, they’ll be ruined for sure!

06:26.630 --> 06:30.260
Hey, just because they would be ruined doesn’t mean they would disappear!

06:30.260 --> 06:32.020
I would be targeted for the rest of my life!

06:32.020 --> 06:35.020
Just because it’s not about you doesn’t mean you can say anything you want!

06:35.570 --> 06:37.320
But it <i>isn’t</i> about me!

06:39.620 --> 06:41.920
You idiots!

06:42.500 --> 06:44.620
He’s a dog of the East.

06:44.620 --> 06:48.680
He’ll spread that picture everywhere and try to wreck my reputation!

06:48.680 --> 06:52.480
Then you shouldn’t have done that where someone could see you…

06:52.480 --> 06:54.710
But that’s what makes it pleasurable!

06:54.710 --> 06:57.920
…is how it is.

06:59.320 --> 07:02.480
But Mihai’s famous around here.

07:02.480 --> 07:03.550
We’ll need to mobilize a lot of people!

07:03.930 --> 07:05.450
Of course!

07:05.450 --> 07:07.810
You of the East, watch me!

07:08.200 --> 07:13.450
I’ll cut the corpse of that ridiculous eyepatched freak to pieces and send it to them in the mail!

07:17.560 --> 07:18.820
Bodyguard?

07:18.820 --> 07:21.660
At least until it quiets down enough.

07:21.660 --> 07:23.370
How much will you pay?

07:31.340 --> 07:32.590
I’m sorry.

07:32.590 --> 07:34.040
Hey, wait!

07:34.410 --> 07:36.520
Sell the photo and pay him later!

07:36.520 --> 07:40.050
As I said, I’ll be targeted for a lifetime if I do that!

07:40.500 --> 07:43.110
Don’t make such a big deal about a few grudges.

07:43.110 --> 07:47.970
That’s everyday life for an amazing hitman like you!

07:47.970 --> 07:50.420
Really!

07:51.650 --> 07:54.660
Cigarette! Just give me some nicotine, any nicotine.

07:54.660 --> 07:55.810
No smoking in here.

07:59.460 --> 08:02.650
I got it, I got it…

08:02.650 --> 08:04.810
I’ll figure it out by myself.

08:04.810 --> 08:07.970
Damn it, I’ll haunt you if I die!

08:07.970 --> 08:09.700
Are you in elementary school?

08:10.350 --> 08:12.540
I hate you all!

08:14.290 --> 08:16.240
Die, you eyepatched freak!

08:23.020 --> 08:24.430
I’ve already been found?

08:24.430 --> 08:26.840
Can you hear me, ladies and gentlemen?

08:29.060 --> 08:31.590
This is the head of the Bourdone family.

08:31.590 --> 08:33.540
Domino Bourdone.

08:33.900 --> 08:37.580
We’ll have you return that top secret file you stole from us.

08:39.370 --> 08:41.740
What are you calling a top secret file?

08:42.140 --> 08:45.630
Even if we return it honestly, we probably can’t go home alive.

08:45.630 --> 08:49.110
Really, I should’ve left this place behind and gone home!

08:49.110 --> 08:50.000
Oh?

08:50.600 --> 08:53.120
Badou… why aren’t you hurt?

08:53.490 --> 08:55.390
Oh, this?

08:55.950 --> 08:58.120
They put a few holes in it, that’s all.

09:00.540 --> 09:04.670
I hate waiting! Cheap tricks won’t work!

09:04.670 --> 09:09.440
I did it… the information to trade is gone…

09:09.440 --> 09:11.000
We’re gonna die!

09:11.000 --> 09:12.980
If you’re gonna die, die by yourself.

09:12.980 --> 09:15.610
Before that, cigarette!

09:15.610 --> 09:18.430
Smoke! Nicotine!

09:19.990 --> 09:21.290
Cigarette!

09:22.480 --> 09:24.900
Cigarette!

09:25.350 --> 09:27.610
H-Hey, don’t go outside!

09:28.020 --> 09:30.400
How can I live without smoking?

09:30.400 --> 09:33.370
A lighter… a lighter… there!

09:39.770 --> 09:41.920
This is your last notice!

09:42.400 --> 09:43.920
Give up and come out!

09:43.920 --> 09:45.750
Dog of the East!

09:55.340 --> 09:57.810
Ba-Badou?

09:59.760 --> 10:02.180
Next time it won’t be just a threat!

10:02.180 --> 10:05.930
If you don’t want to be blown away…!

10:06.860 --> 10:07.860
Hah.

10:08.310 --> 10:09.410
He left…

10:15.370 --> 10:17.750
Really, everyone not taking me seriously…

10:17.750 --> 10:19.030
I can’t stand it!

10:19.980 --> 10:21.350
I can’t hear you.

10:21.350 --> 10:23.210
How about speaking up clearly?

10:24.310 --> 10:26.180
Hey, mister!

10:26.180 --> 10:29.180
Is your ass doing good, you masochist?

10:32.280 --> 10:33.430
Shoot!

10:38.300 --> 10:41.010
Take that!

10:42.950 --> 10:43.770
What?

10:44.200 --> 10:46.820
Hm, you’re pretty good when you try, aren’t you?

10:46.820 --> 10:48.450
Oh, as expected…

10:48.450 --> 10:49.360
As expected?

10:54.680 --> 11:01.180
He’s usually a coward, but when he’s out of nicotine, he gets like that.

11:01.180 --> 11:03.980
You aimed for that knowingly, didn’t you?

11:03.980 --> 11:06.210
I didn’t think it would work <i>this</i> well…

11:06.580 --> 11:07.340
Don’t flinch!

11:14.200 --> 11:15.930
Hmm, feels good!

11:16.620 --> 11:18.810
This smoke isn’t bad, either!

11:18.810 --> 11:20.600
Hey! Shoot!

11:20.600 --> 11:22.020
Don’t underestimate me, you bastard!

11:27.920 --> 11:32.860
Four glass windows, floorboards, rebuilding the walls, dishes…

11:32.860 --> 11:36.370
Total… another glass window…

11:36.840 --> 11:42.300
You’ll be destroyed!

11:55.200 --> 11:57.760
Wh-What are you?

11:57.760 --> 11:59.970
What the hell are you?

12:02.000 --> 12:03.370
Hey you…

12:03.370 --> 12:05.120
Y-Yes?

12:05.680 --> 12:07.520
Do you have some cigarette?

12:08.170 --> 12:10.530
Oh, just as I thought…

12:10.770 --> 12:12.850
He’s an idiot.

12:16.640 --> 12:18.370
That’s delicious!

12:19.170 --> 12:22.810
The misunderstanding was resolved, and we reconciled.

12:22.810 --> 12:28.830
Although the East found out about his hobby, and his family was ruined…

12:29.540 --> 12:32.210
I don’t know what’ll happen in this world,

12:32.210 --> 12:35.920
but that’s what “hard-boiled” is.
